# Force LF for tutorial data and model files, so a stray CRLF write (or a
# Windows checkout under core.autocrlf) can't produce a whole-file diff with
# no content change. All committed data files are LF today; the rain_*.csv
# series briefly picked up CRLF data rows on an LF header, which showed up as
# a 10,958-line diff containing zero content changes.
*.csv  text eol=lf
*.ini  text eol=lf
